1
00:00:07,993 --> 00:00:09,860
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:10,011 --> 00:00:12,144
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,206 --> 00:00:17,362
(Ling Che)
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪

4
00:00:19,233 --> 00:00:22,019
(Shuangdao Hui)
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪

5
00:00:22,804 --> 00:00:27,711
(Dongshan Tai)
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪

6
00:00:28,080 --> 00:00:30,426
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,682 --> 00:00:34,971
(Luo Song)
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪

8
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:39,528
(Annie)
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪

9
00:00:40,497 --> 00:00:44,164
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,859 --> 00:00:48,935
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,302 --> 00:00:52,928
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:53,731 --> 00:00:58,126
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,204 --> 00:01:01,964
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,464 --> 00:01:08,326
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,165 --> 00:01:15,779
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,780 --> 00:01:18,037
(1995)

17
00:01:18,040 --> 00:01:19,319
We were fighting over turf.

18
00:01:19,959 --> 00:01:21,040
None of you were there.

19
00:01:23,400 --> 00:01:24,239
Then why

20
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:25,760
are you the only one hurt?

21
00:01:29,040 --> 00:01:30,040
Nice moves.

22
00:01:31,400 --> 00:01:31,920
Boss Hui.

23
00:01:32,239 --> 00:01:32,920
He's new.

24
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:34,359
He can't really fight yet.

25
00:01:34,359 --> 00:01:37,519
I'm looking for Lin. Lin.

26
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:39,280
Lin! Lin!

27
00:01:39,599 --> 00:01:40,560
Lin, what happened?

28
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,400
Lin.

29
00:01:42,760 --> 00:01:44,840
How did you get hurt this badly?

30
00:01:45,560 --> 00:01:46,079
Are you okay?

31
00:01:47,359 --> 00:01:48,120
Hi.

32
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,000
Hi.

33
00:01:49,879 --> 00:01:51,319
I'm Fu.

34
00:01:51,760 --> 00:01:53,920
Those stickers you gave me last time,

35
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:54,879
do you have any more?

36
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,519
My daughter really likes them.

37
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:59,920
These are my favorite stickers.

38
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:01,439
Here.

39
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,040
Thanks, Fu.

40
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:07,840
Good work, everyone.

41
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,639
Go unwind at the entertainment club.

42
00:02:10,080 --> 00:02:10,919
It's on me.

43
00:02:11,639 --> 00:02:11,960
Let's go.

44
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,759
Thanks, Boss Hui.

45
00:02:16,159 --> 00:02:16,759
Knock it off.

46
00:02:17,120 --> 00:02:17,560
Boss Che.

47
00:02:21,120 --> 00:02:22,159
I didn't expect Boss Hui

48
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:23,400
to accept my brother.

49
00:02:25,280 --> 00:02:26,879
And I'm such a lousy fighter,

50
00:02:27,560 --> 00:02:28,520
but he still accepts me.

51
00:02:29,159 --> 00:02:30,639
If Boss Hui can accept you,

52
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,319
why wouldn't he accept your brother?

53
00:02:38,439 --> 00:02:39,039
Let's go.

54
00:02:39,039 --> 00:02:39,840
Ow, that hurts!

55
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,680
Come on.

56
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:43,639
Let's go.

57
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,039
Where are we going?

58
00:03:06,498 --> 00:03:10,938
♪How many true friends do we find?♪

59
00:03:11,769 --> 00:03:16,133
♪Brotherhood never fades away♪

60
00:03:16,258 --> 00:03:21,520
♪Tonight we gather, raise your glass♪

61
00:03:21,733 --> 00:03:26,569
♪Keep your brothers close at heart♪

62
00:03:26,747 --> 00:03:28,924
♪We part for now♪

63
00:03:29,171 --> 00:03:33,207
♪We'll meet again another day♪

64
00:03:34,184 --> 00:03:36,567
♪No matter how far we may roam♪

65
00:03:36,995 --> 00:03:41,102
♪We'll always be brothers♪

66
00:03:42,759 --> 00:03:43,560
Thanks, Boss Hui.

67
00:03:44,542 --> 00:03:48,040
♪Though we're under different skies♪

68
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,000
Che.

69
00:03:49,439 --> 00:03:49,840
Come here.

70
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:52,639
Come on. Come here.

71
00:03:54,719 --> 00:03:55,360
From now on,

72
00:03:56,159 --> 00:03:57,599
you won't collect parking fees anymore.

73
00:03:58,159 --> 00:03:59,120
Why, Boss Hui?

74
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,680
Did I do something wrong?

75
00:04:01,719 --> 00:04:02,280
No.

76
00:04:03,159 --> 00:04:04,199
You're smart,

77
00:04:05,199 --> 00:04:06,479
and you're a good fighter.

78
00:04:07,599 --> 00:04:08,759
You two make a great team.

79
00:04:09,719 --> 00:04:12,879
You'll bring girls to the nightclub.

80
00:04:13,479 --> 00:04:14,080
Remember,

81
00:04:14,800 --> 00:04:16,519
hostesses don't leave with customers.

82
00:04:17,199 --> 00:04:19,279
Escorts can leave if the customer wants.

83
00:04:19,519 --> 00:04:20,000
Got it?

84
00:04:20,600 --> 00:04:21,399
Got it, Boss Hui.

85
00:04:23,079 --> 00:04:25,399
Nanhu Gang is eyeing these clubs too.

86
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,519
Whether you can hold onto them

87
00:04:27,120 --> 00:04:27,959
depends on what you can do.

88
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,040
Drink up.

89
00:04:31,639 --> 00:04:32,120
Come on.

90
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,399
To Boss Hui.

91
00:04:34,759 --> 00:04:35,360
Boss Hui.

92
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:36,759
To Boss Hui.

93
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:37,399
Boss Hui.

94
00:04:38,243 --> 00:04:40,896
=Episode 24=

95
00:04:40,897 --> 00:04:43,666
(2000)

96
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:58,439
Mr. Wan.

97
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:04,920
Okay.

98
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,439
Boss Lin.

99
00:05:38,200 --> 00:05:44,000
(Dongcheng Tiger)

100
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:46,800
You seem afraid of me.

101
00:05:48,439 --> 00:05:49,319
No, Boss Lin.

102
00:05:49,560 --> 00:05:49,920
I'm not.

103
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:58,920
It's been a long time

104
00:05:59,319 --> 00:06:01,040
since we all had a drink together.

105
00:06:01,839 --> 00:06:02,720
Yeah, Boss Lin.

106
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:07,560
Go get Huogun and Dazui too.

107
00:06:08,519 --> 00:06:08,959
Okay.

108
00:06:48,839 --> 00:06:49,800
Remember

109
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:51,680
our first time at karaoke?

110
00:06:53,600 --> 00:06:55,399
Didn't Tidao have his arm around a girl?

111
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:56,639
He

112
00:06:57,399 --> 00:06:59,600
said he'd ask for her again.

113
00:06:59,600 --> 00:07:00,759
Yeah, he said he'd come back.

114
00:07:01,879 --> 00:07:02,519
That's him.

115
00:07:02,959 --> 00:07:03,959
That was you, wasn't it?

116
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,000
Come on.

117
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:06,920
Come on.

118
00:07:07,240 --> 00:07:07,680
Drink.

119
00:07:33,170 --> 00:07:38,918
♪How long have I walked this road?♪

120
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:40,199
(Without my backing,)

121
00:07:41,199 --> 00:07:42,839
(you really think you could've)

122
00:07:42,839 --> 00:07:44,279
(taken the shot-caller seat
that easily?)

123
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:47,120
(If you don't want to keep that seat,)

124
00:07:48,759 --> 00:07:50,680
(I've got plenty of people
who can replace you.)

125
00:07:50,978 --> 00:07:52,614
♪You have to look up♪

126
00:07:53,954 --> 00:07:59,017
♪I look up and only see gray skies♪

127
00:08:00,639 --> 00:08:01,279
Guys.

128
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:03,639
There's something

129
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:07,399
I need one of you to take care of.

130
00:08:08,639 --> 00:08:09,480
W-We will do it.

131
00:08:09,680 --> 00:08:10,399
Yeah.

132
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:11,600
What is it, Boss?

133
00:08:12,839 --> 00:08:14,000
We've handled plenty before.

134
00:08:29,439 --> 00:08:30,360
This is for your family.

135
00:08:35,279 --> 00:08:35,759
Same rules.

136
00:08:36,159 --> 00:08:36,600
Draw lots.

137
00:09:01,600 --> 00:09:02,600
Dazui, you go first.

138
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:11,159
The l-long one.

139
00:09:39,399 --> 00:09:39,919
Tidao.

140
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:45,519
Take it.

141
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:55,320
I...

142
00:10:00,840 --> 00:10:01,600
Here's to you.

143
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:41,600
Boss Lin.

144
00:10:52,600 --> 00:10:53,440
B-Boss Lin.

145
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,120
I'm heading out.

146
00:11:02,759 --> 00:11:03,559
Boss Lin.

147
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:06,159
About earlier...

148
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,440
Thanks, Boss Lin.

149
00:12:18,519 --> 00:12:21,639
Neither appliances nor gas
caused the fire.

150
00:12:23,720 --> 00:12:26,200
The actual cause is unknown.

151
00:12:29,240 --> 00:12:31,440
Cheng signed off on the case too.

152
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:39,679
Cheng...

153
00:13:32,720 --> 00:13:35,120
(If Cheng does Luo Song's dirty work,)

154
00:13:35,759 --> 00:13:36,679
(then Fu's death...)

155
00:13:37,919 --> 00:13:39,080
(Wang Cheng, Luo Song, Boss Hai, Link?)
(Could he be involved?)

156
00:13:39,081 --> 00:13:40,478
(Case Report Signed By: Wang Cheng)

157
00:13:40,480 --> 00:13:42,120
(Wang Cheng, Luo Song: Roles?)
But why would they kill Fu?

158
00:13:44,039 --> 00:13:45,720
Luo Song refused to let me join the
Criminal Investigation Unit.

159
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:47,799
What was he afraid I'd uncover?

160
00:13:49,759 --> 00:13:50,679
No clearance.

161
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:51,759
No friends.

162
00:13:52,720 --> 00:13:53,679
What can I even investigate?

163
00:14:13,203 --> 00:14:17,847
(Fantasy Is Reality)

164
00:14:18,639 --> 00:14:19,840
What I can't do,

165
00:14:22,159 --> 00:14:23,080
he can.

166
00:14:56,360 --> 00:14:57,639
What's wrong, Officer Lin?

167
00:14:58,200 --> 00:14:58,840
Lin.

168
00:15:04,279 --> 00:15:06,120
Fu's death is on me.

169
00:15:10,039 --> 00:15:11,720
I don't want to hear this.

170
00:15:12,559 --> 00:15:13,879
I have something to show you.

171
00:15:15,799 --> 00:15:16,639
Look at it.

172
00:15:17,200 --> 00:15:18,399
Then decide if you still want to see me.

173
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:24,440
433 Hengtang Li.

174
00:15:37,200 --> 00:15:39,679
Boss Lin, there's... there's...

175
00:16:03,407 --> 00:16:06,203
(No. 433)
